    {
      "name": "UserWithdrawalState",
      "docs": [
        "Per-user withdrawal nonce watermark. A WithdrawalRecord PDA is seeded by",
        "(user, nonce) and closed on completion, so without this a user could",
        "re-initialize a finished withdrawal's address by re-using its nonce. Nonces",
        "must strictly increase per user, which makes every withdrawal address unique",
        "for all time. Created on the user's first request (or pre-seeded by the",
        "authority via `seed_withdrawal_state`) and never closed."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "user",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
